From: Local bring-up for FPT AX3000CV2 (WF-810DF)
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: yt921x: support bridge VLAN filtering with tag_8021q

Keep bridge membership and PVID separate from internal transport VLANs.
Activate only one configuration on user ports, keep CPU membership tagged,
and reject transport VID collisions and ambiguous cross-bridge VID reuse.
Direct port VLAN uppers remain unsupported; use bridge VLAN interfaces.

--- a/drivers/net/dsa/yt921x.h
+++ b/drivers/net/dsa/yt921x.h
@@ -1388,6 +1388,12 @@
